+# Get the data
+The code expects ADBench `.npz` files in `ad_bench/` (see `data.path` in `src/config.yaml`):
+```bash
+mkdir -p ad_bench
+git clone --depth 1 --filter=blob:none --sparse https://github.com/Minqi824/ADBench adbench_src
+git -C adbench_src sparse-checkout set adbench/datasets/Classical
+cp adbench_src/adbench/datasets/Classical/*.npz ad_bench/
+```
+
 # Run experiment
 ```bash
-python run.py --config configs/default.yaml
+python run.py --config src/config.yaml
